London

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.480
DEM Industries Headquarters

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.480
DEM Industries Headquarters

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.820
What the hell are you thinking, Mr. Westcott?!

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.110
I'm not sure I understand what you're asking, Murdock.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.860
Don't play dumb!

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.620
I'm asking about your activities in Japan!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.120
You blatantly interfered with the JSDF,

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.750
used the Wizards and equipment for your own agenda, and worst of all,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.040
you practically turned the place into a war zone!

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.460
We're even losing our hold over the Japanese government. {losing our influence over the Japanese government}

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.800
How do you propose on remedying this situation?!

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.160
Nothing to worry about. Our gains were plentiful.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.050
We successfully inverted Princess.{QC - No idea what these terms are.}

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.580
Do you understand the situation we're in?!

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.040
What benefits do the Spirits bring to DEM?

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.810
We simply cannot afford to play along with your fun and games any longer. {whims and games}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:53.440
Board members, I hereby call for the immediate termination{dismissal} of Westcott as the directing manager.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.880
Do you approve, Mr. Westcott?{Sir}

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:01.700
But of course. It is well within this board's powers to do so.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.960
Now is the time, Chairman Russel. Let's take a vote.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:10.210
Well then, all in favor, raise your hands.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:16.970
None in favor. The movement fails.

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.220
Are you blind, Chairman?! Everyone just—

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.480
I have Realizers on standby in the medical bay. {I'm assuming it's a floor. medical bay otherwise.}

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.980
Those arms should heal right up.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:40.400
I'll let you have this company after I'm done with my "fun and games."

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.990
It won't be long now.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.000
At least not compared to how long we've waited.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.990
